  "system": {
    "identifier": "akimichi-multi-size-arm-missile",
    "description": "<p>When you cast this jutsu you hold your arm out in front of you as it rapidly stretches and expands. All creatures in range must make a Dexterity saving throw taking your [Unarmed Damage] + 2d8 on a failed save or half as much on a success.</p>\n<p>Creatures who failed their saving throw are Bruised, pushed 10 feet, and fall prone.</p>\n<p>Expansion Crash. You can change the ranged to Self (30-foot cone) as you swing your arm in an arc.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the Chakra cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d8. If this jutsu is cast at A-Rank, increase the calorie cost by +1 and on a failed save, affected creatures are Staggered.</p>",
